# DESK15 run C1 -- Options -> "Install icon..." with NOTHING selected: EmuTOS
# asks `STICNTYP` ("Please select icon type." / Desktop | Window | Cancel,
# desk_rsc.c:2534) before it builds anything.  This run only photographs the
# alert; run C2 clicks its *Window* button.
#   Options title centre (196,8); "Install icon..." = drop-down entry 1 (200,43)
100 parkbr
300 move 600 460
1500 mark A_IDLE
1800 move 196 8
2500 mark B_OPTIONS
2800 move 200 43
3100 down
3103 up
3400 move 600 460
4500 mark C_ALERT
